  "details": "I am Japanese, but I cannot speak English, so I am writing through DeepL Translator.\n\nI would like to see a random option added to the search function.\n\nThe good thing about this feature is that it allows random access to specific genres such as “Chill,” which is one of the factors that makes it enjoyable for users.\n\nThis could lead to the rediscovery of worlds that are currently buried among the many worlds available and can be enjoyed on an individual basis (of course, there are also broken worlds, so I think it would be interesting to enjoy them as if they were lottery tickets).",
